<title>CHINA: Shanghai Diesel 1996 net down 4.86 pct.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Diesel 1996 net down 4.86 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover		1,046.031	 vs   1,027.453</p>
<p> Net profit		143.821	 vs     151.164</p>
<p> Net asset per share     3.48 yuan   vs	 3.80 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share	0.30 yuan   vs	 0.46 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Diesel Engine Co Ltd</p>
<p>Note: the results were published in a company statement on Thursday. All numbers are based on domestic accounting standards. Figures based on international accounting standards were not available.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed no cash dividend or bonus shares, pending approval of a shareholders' meeting.</p>
</text>
